      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A worktree costs a working copy,\nnot a copy of the history, so the\ntenth agent is cheap even on a repo\nwith years of commits. Merged work\nis visible to every agent the\nmoment it lands, because there is\none history.",
      "originalText": "A worktree costs a working copy,\nnot a copy of the history, so the\ntenth agent is cheap even on a repo\nwith years of commits. Merged work\nis visible to every agent the\nmoment it lands, because there is\none history.",
