      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "remove is the exit, and a locked\ntree needs unlock first. prune only\nrepairs a directory somebody\ndeleted. Nothing sweeps the\nbranches, which a long swarm piles\nup by the hundred, so they need a\nwritten policy.",
